<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh industry output rose 0.7 pct in August.</title>
<headline>Kazakh industry output rose 0.7 pct in August.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakh industrial production rose 0.7 percent in August after rising 1.6 percent in July, the State Statistics Committee said on Monday.</p>
<p>    KAZAKH INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT	 AUG 96    JUL 96    AUG 95</p>
<p>    month-on-month pct change	 +0.7	+1.6	+3.7</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	   +0.1	UNCH     -10.8</p>
<p>Industrial production in the first eight months of this year was 0.1 percent higher than a year earlier.</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
